Appendix H — Reproducibility Protocol

H.1 Logged fields per API call

Field Content
Client version Package and build identifier
Model version string As returned, where available
Condition identifier Cell type, tissue, assay context
Request timestamp UTC, millisecond resolution
Full request payload Sequence, variant, conditioning, all flags
