Closing Statement of the Appendices

The appendices exist for one purpose: to ensure that no definition, decision, correction, or open question can be silently altered between the written design and the executed analysis. Every formula above is fixed before data access. Every margin is either derived or explicitly marked provisional. Every gate is either resolved by record or blocks inference. Every correction is logged so that the discarded form cannot quietly return.

The framework's central commitment is unchanged and is recorded here as the appendices' final entry: AG2-PACT is not designed to demonstrate that its evidence layer must improve a conditional genomic foundation model. It is designed to test whether it does, and to report the outcome either way without distortion.

